├── when the assertion is well formed
│   └── it should return the verify selector
├── when the digest renders with the url safe characters
│   └── it should return the verify selector
├── when the client data carries an extra trailing field
│   └── it should return the verify selector
├── when the client data is exactly the prefix
│   └── it should return the verify selector
