├── when an extra field sits before the type
│   └── it should refuse the proof
├── when a duplicate challenge member precedes the canonical prefix
│   └── it should refuse the proof
├── when the prefix carries whitespace
│   └── it should refuse the proof
├── when the client data is shorter than the prefix
│   └── it should refuse the proof
├── when the type is webauthn create
│   └── it should refuse the proof
├── when the type value extends webauthn get
│   └── it should refuse the proof
